      "lastApplied": "2026-11-24T18:13:21.098Z"
    },
    {
      "type": "testcase",
      "address": "admin.case.feature.@tc-04",
      "path": "testcase/OrangeHRM/admin.case.feature",
      "tag": "@tc-04",
      "attributes": {
        "localHash": "d42d0a2fb0aa87ef8698535a3b704c0e20f000515eb90d19070c807d569d8b5b",
        "remoteId": "GL#212",
        "issueNumber": 212,
        "createdAt": "2026-11-24T18:13:20.591Z",
        "updatedAt": "2026-11-24T18:13:20.591Z",
        "title": "Agregar un nuevo usuario del sistema",
        "body": "```gherkin\nGiven el usuario ha iniciado sesión como Administrador\nAnd navega a la sección \"Admin\"\nWhen el usuario hace clic en el botón verde \"+ Add\"\nAnd completa los datos requeridos (User Role, Employee Name, Status, Username, Password)\nAnd hace clic en \"Save\"\nThen el sistema guarda al usuario y aparece en la tabla de System Users\n```\n\n### 📋 Metadata\n\n| Field | Value |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Project** | OrangeHRM |\n| **Module** | Admin |\n| **Priority** | high |\n| **Status** | Done |\n| **Type Of Test** | funcional |\n| **Automate** | not apply |",
        "labels": [
          "testcase"
        ],
        "metadata": {
          "project": "OrangeHRM",
          "module": "Admin",
          "priority": "@high",
          "Status": "Done",
          "type_of_test": "funcional",
          "automate": "not apply"
        },
        "status": "done"
      },
      "lastApplied": "2026-11-24T18:13:21.633Z"
    },
    {
